  "design": {
    "idea": "Shrunk tiny, your 1.8x sun-lantern blooms a thorn-wall sealing the dewdrop until you hang it behind a root pillar, roll the dew lens onto the center line, bloom the pit bridge, and burn the north dry root-knot.",
    "kind": "story",
    "beat": "ki",
    "teaches": "1.8x sun-lantern blooms thorn-walls from afar; hiding light behind cover starves them; rolling dew_lens and shooting yellow focuses a dew_ray to burn dry_root_knot.",
    "decisions": 4,
    "expert_s": 40,
    "reward": "ws_underroot+r2_access",
    "why": "Entry threshold of The Under-Root anchoring Waystone 1 and two later return shortcuts (r8, r10).",
